OL,3,GNEWSACar park anti-social behaviour
OL,4,Ameasures extended
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeasures to tackle anti-social
OL,7,Fbehaviour in Lincoln multi-storey car
OL,8,Fparks will remain in place for a
OL,9,Ffurther three years.
OL,11,FA Public Spaces Protection Order (PSPO)
OL,12,Fwas put in place at Lucy Tower,
OL,13,FBroadgate and Lincoln Central in 2020
OL,14,Fand was extended in 2023.
OL,16,FThe order has now been renewed again
OL,17,Fafter City of Lincoln Council said
OL,18,Fpolice data showed there had been 98
OL,19,F"calls for service" across the three
OL,20,Fcar parks so far this year.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
