OL,3,GNEWSACar park anti-social behaviour
OL,4,Ameasures extended
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Jackson, the council's public
OL,7,Fprotection, anti-social behaviour and
OL,8,Flicensing service manager, said: "Our
OL,9,Fcity centre car parks are important
OL,10,Ffacilities for residents, businesses
OL,11,Fand visitors, and we want people to
OL,12,Ffeel safe and confident when using
OL,13,Fthem."
